# Feature Spec: Team Management, Messaging, Candidate Voting & Status System

## 0. Summary

This spec covers four connected features:

1. A global **Mailing icon + button** in the top nav (between username and Audits) that links to `/messages`, a Gmail-style inbox.
2. A per-project **Team page** showing members, their roles/permissions, and role-management actions (kick, promote, demote).
3. A **candidate voting system** (upvote with score, downvote, star) tied to permission level, visible per-candidate and aggregated.
4. A **candidate status pipeline** (Unreviewed → OnCheck → OnInterview → Hired/Closed) gated by permission level.

Note: your original prompt described one "Team" page that mixed messaging and role management together. I've split these into two separate pages — **Team** (roles/permissions only) and **Messages** (Gmail-style inbox) — since that's what you described later in the prompt anyway. Confirm this split is correct before build.

